## Vector Store Consideration
For "Long-term" memory (remembering things from weeks ago), we could add a **Vector Database** (e.g., ChromaDB). This would allow the AI to search through an infinite library of past interactions.
> [!NOTE]
> I will start with **Short-term Memory** (last 10 messages) first, as it's the most impactful for day-to-day chatting.

